'''Island Four''' was the name of an island hunting ground located on the [[moon]] [[Wasskah]] that was used by members of a [[Garnac's hunting guild|hunting guild]] headed by the [[Trandoshan]] [[Garnac]]. [[Jedi]] [[youngling]]s [[Kalifa]], [[Jinx]], and [[O-Mer]], captured by the Trandoshans on training missions, managed to survive on the island for some time before meeting captured [[Padawan]] [[Ahsoka Tano]] when she was brought to the island.<ref name="Padawan Lost" />

